骨までしゃぶって
pick me to the bone!

469
00:30:32,538 --> 00:30:35,358
無理だよって 焦るよって
Saying "No way," making me panic—

470
00:30:35,578 --> 00:30:38,318
からす ハートを振り回して
crowing, tossing my heart around.

471
00:30:38,318 --> 00:30:41,818
骨も髄までしゃぶり尽くして
Sucking me dry to the marrow,

472
00:30:41,818 --> 00:30:44,798
壊れるほど惑わせて
bewitching me to the point of breaking.

473
00:30:45,018 --> 00:30:50,118
You know, You know, You know... 浴びる程転がして
You know, you know, you know... rolling me around till I'm saturated.

474
